{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Behold, I am cutting a covenant.</b> To be in your midst, as the Sages said (Megillah 29a): 'When they were exiled to Babylon, the Shekhinah was with them; when they were exiled to Elam, the Shekhinah was with them; when they were exiled to Edom, the Shekhinah was with them.'" "<b>Before all your people I will do wonders.</b> When they pray by means of these attributes." "<b>And all the people among whom you are shall see.</b> Indeed, the awesome deed of YHWH will not be witnessed by all peoples — only by that people among whom you are, who shall see the deeds of YHWH." "<b>Which I am doing with you.</b> In your merit, as it says (Exodus 33:17): 'For you have found favor in My eyes,' etc."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:05.060687913Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}